      "explanation": "The text announces specific federal funding ($19.1 million) for a local project (Brunswick Harbor Deepening) that was secured in a piece of passed legislation (the final Congressional approval of the fiscal year 2006 Energy and Water Appropriations bill). According to the codebook's clarification, announcing specific local projects and funding inherently implies the member's role in delivering federal resources, qualifying as credit-claiming."
